// # website/docs — Package Manual
//
// Logline: RFC-0005 docs for the website repo. The public pages
//          live in pulled/. Each page cites a sibling docs/.
//
// Setup: No caps. This directory is the package manual for
//        website/. Website Source: for every nav route is
//        openOODA/<repo>/docs/. Do not cite a repo root.
//
// Beats:
//   1. pulled/*.oot Source: line must be openOODA/<repo>/docs/.
//   2. That path must have docs/ANCHOR.oo in the cited repo.
//   3. website and .github have no nav route.
